{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"war-card-game UI copy.fields.summary","detected_language":"sw","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"war-card-game.copy.fields.summary","keys":["war-card-game.copy.fields.summary"],"locale":"sw","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Moja ZXQPH0000QXZ-card deck, hakuna jokeri. Deal sawa kati ya ZXQPH0001QXZ–ZXQPH0002QXZ wachezaji; kuweka kadi moja mbali kwa wachezaji watatu. kadi ya juu inashinda kila flip; suits si jambo. Ace juu, ZXQPH0003QXZ chini. On mkanda, kila mchezaji katika vita anaweka kadi moja chini na moja juu. juu uso-up kadi inachukua wote. Kama huwezi kukamilisha vita, wewe kupoteza. mchezo inaweza kuwa muda mrefu na ni zaidi bahati.","record_id":"cc7f73538c4acc5365527592dc8fc0710a64194985a4dd24090e5a80a2984f67","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":2.3203656372500063,"source":"One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"1d2ad24094c0a116a056a7c33eca4bc529af719cccd080059fe2e87004f523b7","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Moja 52-card deck, hakuna jokeri. Deal sawa kati ya 2–4 wachezaji; kuweka kadi moja mbali kwa wachezaji watatu. kadi ya juu inashinda kila flip; suits si jambo. Ace juu, 2 chini. On mkanda, kila mchezaji katika vita anaweka kadi moja chini na moja juu. juu uso-up kadi inachukua wote. Kama huwezi kukamilisha vita, wewe kupoteza. mchezo inaweza kuwa muda mrefu na ni zaidi bahati.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
